    "text": "townline.org\nwebsite\nOakland\nArea students named to President’s List at Plymouth State University\nBy Website Editor,\n9 hours agoArea students have been named to the Plymouth State University President’s List, in Plymouth, New Hampshire. Included are Dylan Flewelling, Exercise and Sport Physiology major, of Oakland, Riley Johnson, Psychology major, of Windsor, Kaiden Kelley, Art and Design major of South China, and Courtney Peabody, Physical Education major, of Solon.",
